OL,3,ASydney policeman allegedly disguised
OL,4,Ahimself as Uber Eats rider before
OL,5,Amurders
OL,6,
OL,7,FA former police officer accused of
OL,8,Fusing his work gun to kill a Sydney
OL,9,Fcouple was driven by a "jealous
OL,10,Finfatuation" with his ex, a court has
OL,11,Fheard.
OL,13,FBeaumont Lamarre-Condon, 31, has
OL,14,Fpleaded not guilty to two charges of
OL,15,Fdomestic violence-related murder and
OL,16,Fone of aggravated break and enter.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
