OL,3,ASydney policeman allegedly disguised
OL,4,Ahimself as Uber Eats rider before
OL,5,Amurders
OL,6,
OL,7,FProsecutors allege Lamarre-Condon shot
OL,8,Fhis ex-partner, 26-year-old TV
OL,9,Fpresenter Jesse Baird, and Baird's new
OL,10,Fpartner Luke Davies, a 29-year-old
OL,11,FQantas flight attendant, at a home in
OL,12,Fthe Sydney suburb of Paddington in
OL,13,F2024.
OL,15,FThe couple's bodies were found in a
OL,16,Frural area 200km away, hidden in
OL,17,Fsurfboard bags. The trial is expected
OL,18,Fto run for three months.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
